WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.940
Every great story begins with a seed.

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.950
In Tlaxcala, artisan hands plant and care for the corn.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:15.050
IZAMAIZ connects these roots with a new way to care for yourself.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:21.050
Pink corn kernels are slowly ground

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:23.950
until they become a fine powder.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.100
The corn continues its journey.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:34.050
It is added to the mixture that will become your soap.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:35.900
The mixture is whisked,

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.550
poured into molds,

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:42.600
and refrigerated.

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:46.750
Then, each piece reveals its corn-cob shape.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.950
The journey of corn ends in your hands.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:52.250
Your ritual begins here.

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:54.740
From our land to your hands.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:55.850
IZAMAIZ.
